  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "とがった　はっぱで　あいてに　あらしを\nおこす。つかうと　はんどうで\nじぶんの　とくこうが　がくっと　さがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "뾰족한 잎사귀로 상대에게 돌풍을\n일으킨다. 사용하면 반동으로\n자신의 특수공격이 크게 떨어진다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用尖銳的葉子捲起風暴向對手進行攻擊。\n使用後因為反作用力，\n自己的特攻會大幅降低。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Invoque une tempête de feuilles acérées.\nLe contrecoup réduit beaucoup l’Attaque Spéciale\ndu lanceur.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender erzeugt einen Sturm aus scharfen Blättern.\nRückstoß senkt Spezial-Angriff des Anwenders stark.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Envuelve al objetivo con una lluvia de hojas afiladas,\npero reduce mucho su Ataque Especial.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si forma una tempesta di foglie affilate. Il contraccolpo\nriduce di molto l’Attacco Speciale di chi la usa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user whips up a storm of leaves around the\ntarget. The attack’s recoil harshly lowers the user’s\nSp. Atk stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "とがった　はっぱで　相手に　あらしを\nおこす。使うと　反動で\n自分の　特攻が　がくっと　さがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用尖尖的叶片向对手卷起风暴。\n使用之后因为反作用力\n自己的特攻会大幅降低。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Envuelve al objetivo con una lluvia de hojas afiladas,\npero reduce mucho su Ataque Especial.",
      "version_group": {
